OL,3,GNEWSAMan in 50s dies in motorway crash
OL,4,
OL,5,FA section of the M2 in Kent has been
OL,6,Fpartially reopened following a crash in
OL,7,Fwhich a man died, according to police.
OL,9,FKent Police said the pedestrian, in his
OL,10,F50s, was struck by multiple vehicles
OL,11,Fjust after 21:00 GMT on Tuesday on the
OL,12,Fcoastbound carriageway near Medway
OL,13,FServices.
OL,15,FThe M2 had been closed in both
OL,16,Fdirections between junctions three and
OL,17,Ffive (coastbound) and junctions five
OL,18,Fand four (London-bound), but the
OL,19,FLondon-bound section has now reopened.
OL,21,FDetectives are appealing for witnesses
OL,22,Fand anyone with dashcam footage.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
